# Auto detect text files and perform LF normalization. Text files are LF in every checkout
# (마일스톤 3 — 2026-11-25): with core.autocrlf=true a clean Windows clone had CRLF sources, so a
# build there rewrote the tracked bundles' source maps and staged 42 of 140 installer files with
# different bytes than a build on an LF checkout. The engine id already ignores line endings.
* text=auto eol=lf

# R8-20: the MCP bundle is diffed byte for byte against a Linux rebuild in CI
# (.github/workflows/ci.yml, job mcp-parity). Keep the bundle exactly as webpack wrote it
# and keep the TypeScript sources embedded in its source map (sourcesContent) in LF on
# every checkout, so a Windows build and a Linux build produce the same bytes.
media/mcp-server.js -text
media/mcp-server.js.map -text
src/mcp/*.ts text eol=lf
